flowchart TB
    User[Prosecutor or Investigator Persona]
    subgraph Browser[Next.js Frontend]
        Intake[Intake]
        Overview[Overview and Materials]
        Technical[Technical Context]
        Chat[Chat]
        ReportUI[Report]
    end
    subgraph Backend[FastAPI Backend]
        ChatAPI[Chat and Report Routes]
        Raw[Raw Evidence Builder]
        Workflow[Run Workflow]
        Analysis[Main Case Analysis]
        Gap[Gap Analysis and Follow-up]
        Reports[Deterministic Report Service]
        Ingestion[Document Preview Route]
    end
    DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    Provider[LLM Provider Abstraction]
    subgraph RAG[GraphRAG Service]
        Retrieve[Hybrid Retrieval]
        Evaluate[Context Evaluation]
    end
    Qdrant[(Qdrant)]
    Neo4j[(Neo4j)]
    STIX[MITRE ATT&CK STIX 2.1]

    User --> Browser
    Browser --> ChatAPI
    Intake --> Ingestion
    ChatAPI --> DB
    ChatAPI --> Workflow
    Workflow --> Raw
    Raw --> Analysis
    Workflow --> RAG
    Analysis --> Provider
    Gap --> Provider
    Workflow --> Gap
    Workflow --> DB
    Reports --> DB
    ChatAPI --> Reports
    Retrieve --> Qdrant
    Retrieve --> Neo4j
    RAG --> Workflow
    STIX --> Qdrant
    STIX --> Neo4j

